{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ebmaj7]Blessed be the Lord [Abmaj7]my rock
[Ebmaj7]He trains my hands for [Abmaj7]war
[Ebmaj7]My fingers ready for [Abmaj7]battle
[Fm7]Faithful God my for[Bb7sus4]tress
